{
  "uid": "p10-golden-signals",
  "title": "P10 · del síntoma a la causa",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "p10",
    "slo",
    "golden-signals"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tráfico · ¿cuántas peticiones atendemos?",
      "description": "Demanda real por servicio y revisión. /health está excluido.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(service, revision)(rate(sa_http_requests_total{namespace=\"p10\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia · ¿el candidato es más lento?",
      "description": "p95 por hash del Rollout. Un exemplar abre la traza en Tempo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by(le,service,revision)(rate(sa_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"p10\",outcome!=\"client_error\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores · ¿qué revisión falla para el usuario?",
      "description": "Incluye errores GraphQL HTTP 200. Un resultado ausente exige revisar targets.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum by(service,revision)(rate(sa_http_requests_total{namespace=\"p10\",outcome=\"error\"}[1m])) or on(service,revision) 0*sum by(service,revision)(rate(sa_http_requests_total{namespace=\"p10\",outcome!=\"client_error\"}[1m]))) / sum by(service,revision)(rate(sa_http_requests_total{namespace=\"p10\",outcome!=\"client_error\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturación · ¿se acumulan peticiones?",
      "description": "Concurrencia por revisión; comparar con CPU, memoria y límite de recursos.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(service,revision)(sa_http_inflight{namespace=\"p10\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturación · CPU respecto al límite",
      "description": "¿La lentitud coincide con CPU agotada?",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"p10\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[1m])) / sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"p10\",resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturación · memoria respecto al límite",
      "description": "¿Estamos cerca de OOM? Revisar pod específico con kubectl describe.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"p10\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}) / sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"p10\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Negocio · publicaciones creadas por minuto",
      "description": "Mide publicaciones confirmadas y evento enviado; no peticiones intentadas.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(service)(rate(sa_business_operations_total{namespace=\"p10\",operation=\"post_created\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Negocio · comentarios añadidos por minuto",
      "description": "Participación de usuarios: comentarios guardados en la base de datos.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(service)(rate(sa_business_operations_total{namespace=\"p10\",operation=\"comment_added\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{revision}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SLO · ¿qué fracción del presupuesto consumimos?",
      "description": "1 = 100% del presupuesto. Ventana móvil 30d con historia disponible; al inicio no equivale a 30d completos.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sa:slo_error_budget_consumed:30d{namespace=\"p10\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{slo}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SLO · ¿debemos intervenir ahora?",
      "description": "Burn rate: 14.4 junto con 1h activa alerta rápida; 6 junto con 6h/30m activa alerta sostenida.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sa:slo_burn_rate:5m{namespace=\"p10\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{slo}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SLO por revisión · ¿el estable oculta una cohorte fallida?",
      "description": "Mismos objetivos por cohorte. La alerta rápida por revisión no permite que la estable diluya el daño del canary; historia disponible desde que nació la revisión.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sa:slo_revision_error_budget_consumed:30d{namespace=\"p10\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{slo}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Alertmanager",
      "url": "http://localhost:9093",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Runbooks",
      "url": "https://github.com/ariellopezg/Practicas-SA-B-202200185/blob/main/P10/docs/runbooks.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ]
}
